Authentication and Authorization
Register User: POST /auth/register
Login User: POST /auth/login
Logout User: POST /auth/logout
User Management
Create User (Admin only): POST /admin/users
Get User by ID (Admin only): GET /admin/users/:id
Update User (Admin only): PUT /admin/users/:id
Delete User (Admin only): DELETE /admin/users/:id
List Users (Admin only): GET /admin/users
Get Profile (Authenticated User): GET /users/profile
Update Profile (Authenticated User): PUT /users/profile
Role Management
Create Role: POST /admin/roles
Get Role by ID: GET /admin/roles/:id
Update Role: PUT /admin/roles/:id
Delete Role: DELETE /admin/roles/:id
List Roles: GET /admin/roles
Exam Management (Teacher only)
Create Exam: POST /teacher/exams
Get Exam by ID: GET /teacher/exams/:id
Update Exam: PUT /teacher/exams/:id
Delete Exam: DELETE /teacher/exams/:id
List Exams: GET /teacher/exams
Assign Subject to Exam: POST /teacher/exams/:examId/subjects
List Subjects for Exam: GET /teacher/exams/:examId/subjects
Question Management (Teacher only)
Create Question: POST /teacher/questions
Get Question by ID: GET /teacher/questions/:id
Update Question: PUT /teacher/questions/:id
Delete Question: DELETE /teacher/questions/:id
List Questions: GET /teacher/questions
Add Options to Question: POST /teacher/questions/:questionId/options
List Options for Question: GET /teacher/questions/:questionId/options
Student Management (Teacher only)
List Students: GET /teacher/students
Get Student by ID: GET /teacher/students/:id
Get Student Results: GET /teacher/students/:id/results
Exam Participation (Student only)
List Available Exams: GET /student/exams
Get Exam Details: GET /student/exams/:id
Submit Exam: POST /student/exams/:id/submit
Get Exam Results: GET /student/exams/:id/results
